Date: Fri, 4 Oct 2024 21:16:43 +1300
Subject: [PATCH 066/164] x86/virt/tdx: Add SEAMCALL wrapper to enter/exit TDX
 guest

TDX uses TDH.VP.ENTER to enter the TDX guest.  When TDX module decides
it needs to exit back to host VMM, the TDH.VP.ENTER returns.

Unlike to other SEAMCALls, TDH.VP.ENTER uses all registers in 'struct
tdx_module_args' as input/output, with RCX always set to vCPU's TDVPR
(for baseline TDX support).

Add a wrapper which takes both TDVPR and 'struct tdx_module_args *' as
arguments for TDH.VP.ENTER.

Signed-off-by: Kai Huang <kai.huang@intel.com>
