From dfc8deae768083959c0ca3eb891c1bf5ca4c967a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erdem Aktas <erdemaktas@google.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Jun 2024 01:15:12 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 131/164] KVM: selftests: TDX: Adding test case for TDX port IO

Verifies TDVMCALL<INSTRUCTION.IO> READ and WRITE operations.

Signed-off-by: Erdem Aktas <erdemaktas@google.com>
Signed-off-by: Sagi Shahar <sagis@google.com>
Signed-off-by: Ackerley Tng <ackerleytng@google.com>
